// Two nested 24h windows (a 48h horizon), under an event schema that raises `max_horizon` to 48h:
// both validate it. The read at @100000, 27.8h after the login response, is allowed through the
// intermediate login request at @50000, which lies within 24h of the response.
@id("read_after_login_nested")
permit (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"Read",
    resource
)
when temporal {
    formerly within 24h (formerly within 24h Drupe::Action::"Login"::response{ input.user: context.input.user })
};
